  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1) The proposed fence by reason of its siting and height will detract from the open nature of the road by creating a structure than is overbearing and visually intrusive element in the street scene. This is contrary to policies ENV.B.1.1 (New Development) and ENV.N.1.11 (Protection and Improvement of Local Open Space) of the adopted London Borough Of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan 2003.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2) No information regarding the siting of the fence in relation to the existing landscaping has been provided for the Council to determine that the landscape features will not be adversely affected. This is contrary to policies ENV.N.2.6 (Landscape Features) ENV.N.2.7 (Trees and Community Woodlands) of the adopted London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan 2003.\r\n\r\n"
